<% if @fallback %>[<%= @order.vendor.name %> has no email address in the Vendors list, so this order was sent to you. Please forward it to the vendor.]

<% end %>Purchase order <%= @order.number %>
Dear <%= @order.vendor.name %>, please supply the following.

Vendor Order Number: <%= @order.number %>
Original PO Number: <%= @placement.po_number %>
PO Line Number: <%= @placement.po_line_number %>
Order Type: <%= @placement.order_type %>
Part Number: <%= @placement.part_number %>
SASH Part: <%= @product&.sash_part.presence || "—" %>
Vendor Part: <%= (@order.vendor.vendor_products.find_by(product_id: @placement.product_id)&.vendor_part || @product&.vendor_part).presence || "—" %>
Description: <%= @product&.description.presence || "—" %>
Quantity: <%= format_qty(@order.qty) %>
Ship Date: <%= @placement.ship_date.strftime("%-d %b %Y") %>
Due Date: <%= @placement.due_date&.strftime("%-d %b %Y") || "—" %>

Please quote <%= @order.number %> on all documents for this order.
